==Trivia==
* The name "Sol Heredit" comes from the Latin words ''[[wiktionary:sol#Latin|sōl]]'' ("sun") and ''[[wiktionary:heredito#Latin|hērēditō]]'' ("to inherit"), loosely translating as "Heir of the Sun".

